{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A whimsical RPG adventure</strong> where a loving couple <strong>must vanquish the four Elemental Demon Lords!</strong> There's just one problem- the <strong>girlfriend is lusted after by the denizens of this realm</strong>, and the <strong>boyfriend has a huge cuckold fetish!</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653260/extras/8b11712edf44e5ca6b6f1fedaa1b60a9.avif?t=1768856067\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Open-Ended Sandbox World</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Defeat the four Elemental Demon Lords in whichever order you choose</strong>, interacting with NPCs and learning more about the world as you go. After you defeat each boss, you can encourage <strong>Sunny</strong>, <strong>your girlfriend</strong>, to become increasingly <strong>&quot;friendly&quot;</strong> with the residents of this world! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2653260/extras/81c3221f91f088736f97d38635569543.avif?t=1768856067\" width=600 height=150 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Non-Linear Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat itself features <strong>equipment-based character power</strong>, there is <strong>no need to worry about grinding for experience points</strong>. It's much more important to <strong>explore the world, discovering hidden treasures and completing quests</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Smorgasbord of Art:</strong> Over 500 illustrations spanning a wide range of fetishes and kinks!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- <strong>Additional Party Members:</strong> featuring unique &quot;interactions&quot; with you or your girlfriend</p></li><li><p class=